#: ../../linux/filters/index.rst:2
msgid "Filter - 流过滤器"
msgstr "Filter - Stream Filters"

#: ../../linux/filters/index.rst:4
msgid "过滤器对流数据进行加工，产生另一个流。 过滤器可以单独使用，但它们经常串在一起形成管道，对流数据排序，统计字数和行数，以及翻译字符等。[#]_"
msgstr "A filter processes stream data and produces another stream. Filters can be used on their own, but are often chained together to form a pipeline, sorting stream data, counting words and lines, translating characters, and so on. [#]_"

